
Local Repository
    ~/.viator
        - repo
            - com.example [Group Name]
                - libexample [Package Name]
                    - 1.0.0 [Version]
                        - aabbccddeeff [Variant Hash]
                            - metadata.json
                            - libexample.so
                            - libexample.a
                            - headers
        - viator.conf [Hocon Config for Viator Settings]

Project Directory
    - .viator/               [Cache and other stuff]
        - .gitignore         [Ignore cache files]
        - cache/             [Cache]
        - dependency.lock    [Dependency lock file
        - project.lock       [Avoid two viator instances running in the same project root]
    - build/                 [Build dir]
        - intermediates/     [Build intermediates]
        - latest/            [Contains the last successful build results; symlink if possible; else copy]
        - out/
            - variant-hash/  [Contains the last build results of this variant]
    - src/                   [Default Source Dir with headers mixed]
    - ViatorFile
    - viatorw                [Planned in V2, viator wrapper, just like gradlew]